{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-encoder-rerank","title":"交叉编码器重排与延迟预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/rerank-filter/cross-encoder-rerank","wordCount":2851,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"交叉编码器重排与延迟预算\">交叉编码器重排与延迟预算</h1><p>重排是检索链路里唯一&quot;读得懂语义&quot;的环节。召回阶段的两种方法都在避免真正的语义交互：BM25 数词频和逆文档频率，向量检索算两个向量的距离——它们都把查询和文档各自编码成一个表示，然后比较表示。交叉编码器（cross-encoder）不这么做，它把查询与文档拼成一个序列送进 Transformer，让注意力机制在两者之间直接建立联系，输出一个相关性分数。质量提升来自这里，成本也来自这里：每条候选一次完整的前向推理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>重排（re-ranking）指在召回之后、返回之前，用比召回阶段更强的模型对候选集重新排序。它成立的前提是候选集已经被缩小到可接受的规模——召回负责&quot;别漏&quot;，重排负责&quot;排对&quot;，两者的分工来自一个成本事实：能做好精排的模型通常无法承担全库检索的算力。</p>\n<p>这个分工对应两类模型架构。召回用的双编码器（bi-encoder）把查询与文档分别编码成向量，因此文档向量可以离线预计算，检索时只需算距离；重排用的交叉编码器（cross-encoder）把查询与文档拼接后一起送进 Transformer，让注意力在两者之间直接交互，因而无法预计算文档侧表示。质量差就来自这个交互能力的差异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>可行模型</th>\n<th>候选规模</th>\n<th>单位成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>召回</td>\n<td>高召回、可扩展</td>\n<td>双编码器、BM25</td>\n<td>全库</td>\n<td>每查询一次编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重排</td>\n<td>高精度排序</td>\n<td>交叉编码器</td>\n<td>几十至几百</td>\n<td>每候选一次推理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;召回: 双编码器 + ANN&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;候选集 50-200 条&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;交叉编码器逐条算分&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;按新分数重排&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;返回 top-k&quot;]&#10;  F[&quot;预算约束&quot;] --&gt; G[&quot;候选数 = 剩余延迟预算 / 单条推理耗时&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  A[\"召回: 双编码器 + ANN\"] --&gt; B[\"候选集 50-200 条\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"交叉编码器逐条算分\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"按新分数重排\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"返回 top-k\"]\n  F[\"预算约束\"] --&gt; G[\"候选数 = 剩余延迟预算 / 单条推理耗时\"]\n  G --&gt; C</pre><p>图右下方的预算约束是这一篇的第二个主题：重排的质量上限由候选集规模决定，而候选集规模由延迟预算决定，因此&quot;重排做多深&quot;是一个可计算的工程决定而不是可以随意调的参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双编码器与交叉编码器的结构性差异\">双编码器与交叉编码器的结构性差异</h2><p>把两种架构的区别说清楚，后面所有的预算计算才有依据。</p>\n<p>双编码器（bi-encoder）把查询与文档分别编码：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(q, d) = \\cos\\big(f(q),\\, f(d)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是 embedding 模型。文档的表示可以预先算好（这就是 ANN 索引存在的前提），查询的表示在请求时算一次。因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 之间没有交互，模型无法知道&quot;这两个词的组合在此上下文里意味着什么&quot;。</p>\n<p>交叉编码器把两者拼在一起编码：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(q, d) = g\\big([q; d]\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 也是一个 Transformer，但它的注意力层能让查询里的每个词直接&quot;看见&quot;文档里的每个词。代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(q,d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 无法预计算——文档变了没变都得重算，且每条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(q, d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 组合一次推理。因此交叉编码器不可能替代 ANN 做全库检索，只能用在候选集（几十到几百条）上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>双编码器（召回）</th>\n<th>交叉编码器（重排）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>查询、文档分别编码</td>\n<td>查询与文档拼成一个序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档表示可否预计算</td>\n<td>可以（ANN 索引的基础）</td>\n<td>不可以</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次成本</td>\n<td>查询编码一次，检索 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级</td>\n<td>每条候选一次完整推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展的候选规模</td>\n<td>全库</td>\n<td>几十到几百条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关性质量</td>\n<td>中等（无词-词交互）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在链路中的位置</td>\n<td>第一段</td>\n<td>第二段（召回之后）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  Q[查询] --&gt; B1[&quot;双编码器: 编码查询&quot;]&#10;  Q --&gt; C1[&quot;交叉编码器: 拼接 query + doc&quot;]&#10;  D1[&quot;全库文档向量 (预计算)&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;ANN 检索&quot;]&#10;  B1 --&gt; A&#10;  A --&gt; N[&quot;候选集 top-N&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt; C1&#10;  C1 --&gt; S[&quot;相关性分数&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; R[&quot;重排结果 top-k&quot;]\">graph LR\n  Q[查询] --&gt; B1[\"双编码器: 编码查询\"]\n  Q --&gt; C1[\"交叉编码器: 拼接 query + doc\"]\n  D1[\"全库文档向量 (预计算)\"] --&gt; A[\"ANN 检索\"]\n  B1 --&gt; A\n  A --&gt; N[\"候选集 top-N\"]\n  N --&gt; C1\n  C1 --&gt; S[\"相关性分数\"]\n  S --&gt; R[\"重排结果 top-k\"]</pre><p>图中&quot;全库文档向量&quot;这条边只出现在双编码器路径上，这是交叉编码器无法单独使用的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"es-里的重排实现-text_similarity_reranker\">ES 里的重排实现：text_similarity_reranker</h2><p>ES 9.x 把这个过程包装成 <code>text_similarity_reranker</code> retriever，它接收一个子 retriever 产生的候选集，用 rerank 任务类型的推理端点重新排序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"POST /documents/_search&#10;{&#10;  &quot;retriever&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;text_similarity_reranker&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;retriever&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;rrf&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;retrievers&quot;: [&#10;            { &quot;retriever&quot;: { &quot;standard&quot;: { &quot;query&quot;: { &quot;match&quot;: { &quot;body&quot;: &quot;hybrid search latency&quot; } } } } },&#10;            { &quot;retriever&quot;: { &quot;knn&quot;: { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;body_vector&quot;, &quot;query_vector&quot;: [0.1, 0.2, 0.3], &quot;k&quot;: 50 } } }&#10;          ],&#10;          &quot;rank_window_size&quot;: 50&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;field&quot;: &quot;body&quot;,&#10;      &quot;inference_id&quot;: &quot;.rerank-v1-elasticsearch&quot;,&#10;      &quot;inference_text&quot;: &quot;hybrid search latency&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rank_window_size&quot;: 50,&#10;      &quot;min_score&quot;: 0.1&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;size&quot;: 10&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">POST /documents/_search</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"retriever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"text_similarity_reranker\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"retriever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"rrf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"retrievers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"retriever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hybrid search latency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } } } } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"retriever\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"knn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"body_vector\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"query_vector\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"k\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"rank_window_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inference_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".rerank-v1-elasticsearch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inference_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hybrid search latency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rank_window_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"min_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>参数的分工值得逐个确认：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>必填</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>retriever</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>产生初始候选集的子 retriever（可以是 <code>rrf</code>、<code>linear</code>、<code>knn</code>、<code>standard</code> 等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>field</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>用文档的哪个字段与 <code>inference_text</code> 做相似度比对，应当是承载语义的文本字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inference_id</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>rerank 任务的推理端点；不指定时默认用预配置的 <code>.rerank-v1-elasticsearch</code>（Elastic Rerank 交叉编码器模型）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inference_text</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>用于比对的查询文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rank_window_size</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>参与重排的候选条数，默认 10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min_score</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低于该阈值的文档被排除；注意分值口径随模型变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>filter</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>对子 retriever 应用额外过滤；与子 retriever 自带的过滤是并集关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chunk_rescorer</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>9.4 起 GA；对长文档先分块、只把得分最高的块送进重排模型，避免被模型 token 上限截断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（参数语义与默认值来源：Elasticsearch text_similarity_reranker retriever 参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/text-similarity-reranker-retriever）\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/text-similarity-reranker-retriever）</a></p>\n<p><code>chunk_rescorer</code> 值得单独说明，因为它解决的是重排里一个隐蔽的质量问题：交叉编码器有输入长度上限，长文档被截断后，真正相关的那一段可能根本没进模型。它的参数是 <code>size</code>（送入重排的块数，默认 1）与控制分块方式的相关设置，效果是&quot;只把最好的块送去算分&quot;，同时也降低了推理的 token 消耗。（来源：Elasticsearch text_similarity_reranker retriever 参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/text-similarity-reranker-retriever）\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/text-similarity-reranker-retriever）</a></p>\n<p>分数口径有一个必须知道的行为：ES 对重排返回的分数做了归一化，公式是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>score</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mtext>score</mtext></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = \\max(\\text{score}, 0) + \\min(e^{\\text{score}}, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">score</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>目的是避免出现负分。它的效果是把原本为负的分数投影到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、原本为正的分数投影到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1, \\infty)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。反推公式也给出了：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时原分数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln(\\text{score})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这意味着 <code>min_score</code> 的阈值不能照搬其他模型的经验值，必须针对所用模型重新标定。（来源：Elasticsearch text_similarity_reranker retriever 参考, <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/text-similarity-reranker-retriever）\">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/retrievers/text-similarity-reranker-retriever）</a></p>\n<p>可用的重排模型来源有四条路：预配置的 Elastic Rerank 端点、Cohere Rerank 推理端点（<code>rerank</code> 任务类型）、Google Vertex AI 推理端点（<code>rerank</code> 任务类型）、以及用 Eland 把 <code>text_similarity</code> 任务的模型上传后用 Elasticsearch 服务端点承载。选择时除了质量，还要考虑模型运行位置（本地推理 vs 外部 API 往返）对延迟与出网策略的影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟预算的算术\">延迟预算的算术</h2><p>重排的延迟由三项构成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>rerank</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>per-doc</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fixed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{rerank}} = N_{\\text{candidates}} \\times T_{\\text{per-doc}} + T_{\\text{fixed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rerank</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">candidates</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">per-doc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fixed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>candidates</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{candidates}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">candidates</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由 <code>rank_window_size</code> 决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>per-doc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{per-doc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">per-doc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取决于模型与硬件，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fixed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fixed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fixed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是请求编排与网络开销。这个式子是线性的，因此在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>per-doc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{per-doc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">per-doc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的前提下，&quot;候选数&quot;就是你唯一的预算旋钮。</p>\n<p>用一组量级做示例：如果单条候选的推理耗时在 10 毫秒量级（这是自托管交叉编码器在小 GPU 或 CPU 上常见的量级），那么 50 条候选就是约 500 毫秒，100 条约 1000 毫秒。这个数字通常已经超出交互式搜索的延迟预算，因此实践中的组合是：召回通道开大（<code>rank_window_size</code> 在召回层设 100–200），重排通道收窄（重排的 <code>rank_window_size</code> 设 20–50）。</p>\n<p>预算分配的正确顺序是倒推：先定下用户可接受的总延迟上限，减去 ANN 检索、BM25 检索、融合、网络与渲染的耗时，剩下的就是重排可用的时间；再除以单条推理耗时，得到候选数的上限。若这个上限小于召回窗口，说明要么缩小召回窗口（接受召回损失），要么换更快的重排方案。</p>\n<p>三种可行的加速手段各有明确的代价：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用外部 API 的重排服务：把推理成本转移出去，但引入网络往返与出网依赖，且 token 计费随候选数与文档长度增长。</li>\n<li>用 <code>chunk_rescorer</code> 控制送入模型的 token 量：降低单条耗时，代价是丢掉未被选中的块里的信息。</li>\n<li>把重排改为只作用于头部候选（例如只对前 30 条重排，其余保持原序）：这实际上是放弃了对长尾的重排，如果原始排序的长尾质量差，收益会打折。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  L[&quot;总延迟预算&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;ANN 检索&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; B[&quot;BM25 检索&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; C[&quot;融合&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; D[&quot;重排&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; E[&quot;网络与渲染&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; N[&quot;候选数上限 = 剩余预算 / 单条耗时&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt; M{&quot;候选数上限 &lt; 召回窗口?&quot;}&#10;  M --&gt;|是| P[&quot;缩小窗口 或 换更快模型 或 分块降 token&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt;|否| Q[&quot;按召回窗口设置重排窗口&quot;]\">graph TD\n  L[\"总延迟预算\"] --&gt; A[\"ANN 检索\"]\n  L --&gt; B[\"BM25 检索\"]\n  L --&gt; C[\"融合\"]\n  L --&gt; D[\"重排\"]\n  L --&gt; E[\"网络与渲染\"]\n  D --&gt; N[\"候选数上限 = 剩余预算 / 单条耗时\"]\n  N --&gt; M{\"候选数上限 &lt; 召回窗口?\"}\n  M --&gt;|是| P[\"缩小窗口 或 换更快模型 或 分块降 token\"]\n  M --&gt;|否| Q[\"按召回窗口设置重排窗口\"]</pre><p>第四行给出了一个常被忽略的判据：如果重排的候选上限小于召回窗口，那么超出的那部分召回结果实际上没有被重排——它们要么被直接丢弃，要么保持原序排在重排结果之后。这两种处理方式的差别应当在设计时明确写出，而不是让实现细节决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-opensearch-的-rerank-处理器对照\">与 OpenSearch 的 rerank 处理器对照</h2><p>OpenSearch 在 search pipeline 里有独立的 <code>rerank</code> 处理器，职责与 ES 的 <code>text_similarity_reranker</code> 重合但位置不同：ES 的重排是 retriever（结果集转换），OpenSearch 的重排是 pipeline 阶段（对已有结果做后处理）。这个位置差异带来两个实际区别：OpenSearch 的重排可以对任何查询（包括普通 BM25 查询，不限于混合检索）生效；而 ES 的 retriever 体系要求整个查询都用 retriever 描述。反过来，ES 的写法能在一次请求里完整表达&quot;召回 + 融合 + 重排&quot;的链路，OpenSearch 需要&quot;查询 + pipeline 引用&quot;两段配置。</p>\n<p>另一个技术栈上的选择是不要在检索系统里做重排，而是在应用层做——召回结果返回给应用，应用调用自己的重排服务。这条路的好处是模型选型不受检索系统约束、可以随业务迭代；坏处是检索结果要完整传到应用（数据出网面变大）、且多一跳网络。判据是模型是否会频繁更换：如果重排模型是业务核心迭代对象，放在应用层更灵活；如果重排只是标准化的相关性提升，放在检索系统内更省运维。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>双编码器把查询与文档分别编码，因此文档表示可预计算，这是 ANN 可行的前提；交叉编码器把两者拼在一起编码，质量更高但每条候选一次推理。</li>\n<li>ES 用 <code>text_similarity_reranker</code> retriever 实现重排，关键参数是 <code>field</code>、<code>inference_text</code>、<code>rank_window_size</code>、<code>min_score</code>，以及 9.4 起 GA 的 <code>chunk_rescorer</code>（对长文档只重排最佳块）。</li>\n<li>重排分数被归一化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(s, 0) + \\min(e^s, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<code>min_score</code> 阈值必须按所用模型重新标定，不能沿用其他模型的经验值。</li>\n<li>重排延迟近似为&quot;候选数 × 单条耗时 + 固定开销&quot;，因此预算分配应倒推：先定总延迟上限，再算候选数上限。</li>\n<li>常见配置是召回窗口开大（100–200）、重排窗口收窄（20–50）；如果重排上限小于召回窗口，超出部分未被重排这一事实必须在设计里写明。</li>\n<li>OpenSearch 把重排做成 search pipeline 的 <code>rerank</code> 处理器，位置与 ES 的 retriever 不同，因此可作用于任何查询，但难以在一次请求里描述完整链路。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>重排提升了头部排序质量之后，下一个常见瓶颈是&quot;带过滤条件时候选集塌掉&quot;——这属于召回侧的问题，见 <a href=\"filtered-ann\">过滤 ANN：先过滤 vs 后过滤</a>；如果多路信号的融合与重排需要统一编排，见 <a href=\"field-capability\">多字段/多向量与学习排序融合</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交叉编码器重排与延迟预算","id":"交叉编码器重排与延迟预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"双编码器与交叉编码器的结构性差异","id":"双编码器与交叉编码器的结构性差异"},{"level":2,"text":"ES 里的重排实现：text_similarity_reranker","id":"es-里的重排实现-text_similarity_reranker"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟预算的算术","id":"延迟预算的算术"},{"level":2,"text":"与 OpenSearch 的 rerank 处理器对照","id":"与-opensearch-的-rerank-处理器对照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"线性加权归一化与调参","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/hybrid-fusion/linear-weighted"},"next":{"title":"过滤 ANN：先过滤 vs 后过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/rerank-filter/filtered-ann"}}